// TST_INGP — Rack / MetaModule port of tst_ingp.mxt (engine: engines/tstingp, the plugin's
// JUCE-free engine with its namespaces renamed; Embedded.h = the example texts and the SDIF
// frames the factory presets use, generated by tools/tstingp_embed.cpp).
//
// The patch: a text becomes a 64 x 32 bit field (every character's ASCII code in binary, no
// padding). 32 sines read it row by row, each with its own counter; a 1 opens the voice.
// GENERATIONIZE walks a cursor over the field and rewrites the cell under it with a 32-bit
// rule over (self, left, right, up, down).
//
// Rack: BPM is the fallback metro; CLK / RST / BUS POS clock the steps. RUN is a gate (closes
// every voice when low). V/OCT transposes on top of TUNE, TILT CV adds to TILT. POKE applies
// the rule around the cursor (the patch's click on the LCD). Any file can be the text (menu).

